{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Amazon 為 Apple 的 2026 年款 AirTag 2 帶來歷史新低價，<a href=\"https://amzn.to/4gsuhUn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">四個裝售價低至每個 17 美元</a>。這款次世代 AirTag 2 上週已因週年慶促銷而創下歷史低價，若錯過上次優惠也不必擔心，因為最新售價再創新低。目前 Amazon 上單個 AirTag 2 售價為 23 美元，與發售以來最低價持平，但四個裝已降至 69.99 美元並含運費。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"與 AirTag 2 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"630\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/airtag-1.png\" width=\"1200\"/></figure>\n<h2>AirTags 2 重點功能</h2>\n<p><strong>升級第二代超寬頻晶片（U2）</strong>：偵測距離提升約 50%，在更遠的距離就能在 iPhone 螢幕上觸發精確尋找的指引箭頭與距離讀數，大幅縮短在大型停車場或寬闊空間找東西的時間。</p>\n<p><strong>揚聲器音量提升 50%：</strong>內部發聲結構經過改良，音量顯著放大且音調穿透力更強，掉進厚沙發縫隙、被外套重壓或塞在行李箱深處時，能更容易清楚辨識位置。</p>\n<p><strong>支援 Apple Watch 精確尋找</strong>：除了 iPhone 外，搭配支援的新款 Apple Watch（如 Series 9、Ultra 2 或後續機型），直接在手腕上就能看到方向箭頭導航到物品位置，不需特地掏出手機。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GJTXVN9Z?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple AirTag (2nd Generation) - 4 Pack: Tracker for Keychain, Wallet, and More; Locator with Sound; Simple One-Tap Setup with iPhone or iPad; Key Finder with up to 1.5X Precision Finding Range*\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31l2rVm48QL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GJTXVN9Z?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple AirTag (2nd Generation) - 4 Pack: Tracker for Keychain, Wallet, and More; Locator with Sound; Simple One-Tap Setup with iPhone or iPad; Key Finder with up to 1.5X Precision Finding Range*</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$69.99</p>\n<p>$99.00</p>\n<p>-29%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GJTXVN9Z?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GJTFXNRX?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple AirTag (2nd Generation): Tracker for Keychain, Wallet, and More; Locator with Sound; Simple One-Tap Setup with iPhone or iPad; Key Finder with up to 1.5X Precision Finding Range\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31q7ggp+2rL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GJTFXNRX?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple AirTag (2nd Generation): Tracker for Keychain, Wallet, and More; Locator with Sound; Simple One-Tap Setup with iPhone or iPad; Key Finder with up to 1.5X Precision Finding Range</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$23.00</p>\n<p>$29.00</p>\n<p>-21%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GJTFXNRX?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<h2>為什麼會顯示沒有貨？</h2>\n<p>如果大家的 Amazon 帳號設定了本地地址，這樣當顯示美國限定產品時是會顯示「沒有供應」，然而大家只要輸入一些<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/2019/05/06/buy-and-ship/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">集運公司的地址</a>，這樣就可以正常顯示價格及送貨。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/amazon-us-address.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"amazon us address\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"545\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/amazon-us-address-1024x545.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<h2>購買美版的 AppleCare 保修問題</h2>\n<p>不少人也對海外購買 Apple 產品的保修有疑問，其實 Apple 產品很多時也是全球性維修，不過 AppleCare+ 的意外換機則必須要原來的購買地才可。那就是你不能買美國版 AppleCare+ 在香港／台灣要求意外更換，必須要在美國更換。不過，維修一般沒有問題，當然每個地區的 Apple Store 也有其不同的。</p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T00:46:42.241902+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1190,"images":4,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T14:38:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T15:17:37.055440+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T00:40:09.891658+00:00","content_hash":"8ec2750ec4c98d602d8555e295dedf4298242bfdc58bf5f82188ddf1c38567e0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}